  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At the moment only the contact receiver can trigger animation parameters.  \nIt would be nice if the contact sender also could optionally trigger them when they collide with a receiver.\nAs an example:\nIf I want to trigger an animation on my avatar when I touch someones nose they would need a sender on their nose. But the likely setup will be they only have a receiver on it and not both.  \nHaving the sender trigger parameters on collision would make that possible.",
